      "payload": {
        "progress": "PR #24 open. Design: per-ticket archive file (events/archive/<id>.jsonc) — ticket reads stay lean; index/cascade proven safe on loose-only reads; cross-clone close-vs-append merges conflict-free (verified with real git merge in tests); double-close conflicts match the existing ticket-file conflict class, dedupe-by-id makes either resolution lossless. reindex --compact for retroactive sweeps. Measured: 10x events file-count reduction, list ~15-30% faster. Post-merge coordinator chore: run reindex --compact on this repo's tracker."
      },
      "at": "2026-08-02T23:55:18.736Z"
    },
